flowchart LR
    accTitle: Phoenix telemetry flow
    accDescr: A FastAPI chat request creates a root chat span with orchestrator, analysis, agent, model, and tool child spans. An OTLP HTTP batch exporter sends traces to Arize Phoenix, configured from endpoint and API-key secrets in AWS Secrets Manager.
    API[FastAPI chat request] --> Root[sherlock.chat.turn]
    Root --> Workflow[orchestrator / analysis spans]
    Workflow --> GenAI[Strands agent, model, tool spans]
    Root --> Exporter[OTLP HTTP batch exporter]
    Exporter --> Phoenix[Arize Phoenix]
    Secret[AWS Secrets Manager<br/>endpoint + API key] --> Exporter
